{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-12","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：素数与互素与连比例与比例","englishTitle":"If as many numbers as we please beginning from an unit be in continued proportion, by however many prime numbers the last is measured, the next to the unit will also be measured by the same.","book":9,"number":12,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.12","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.12/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":12,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","contentId":"euclid-9-12","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"61d0ec606a6e30cb5b18547e0066bd65b2a7c0f20e95d9956f9daa58ec52bcb7","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-12.statement","euclid-9-12.construction.1","euclid-9-12.construction.2","euclid-9-12.proof.1","euclid-9-12.proof.2","euclid-9-12.proof.3","euclid-9-12.proof.4","euclid-9-12.proof.5","euclid-9-12.proof.6","euclid-9-12.construction.3","euclid-9-12.proof.7","euclid-9-12.proof.8","euclid-9-12.proof.9","euclid-9-12.proof.10","euclid-9-12.construction.4","euclid-9-12.proof.11","euclid-9-12.proof.12","euclid-9-12.proof.13","euclid-9-12.proof.14","euclid-9-12.proof.15","euclid-9-12.proof.16","euclid-9-12.proof.17","euclid-9-12.proof.18","euclid-9-12.proof.19","euclid-9-12.conclusion","euclid-9-12.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-12.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb1266f1a4207ec26ae3cf6daa855b136ab8b8feec8774b908662af7c6acd647","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If as many numbers as we please beginning from an unit be in continued proportion, by however many prime numbers the last is measured, the next to the unit will also be measured by the same."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从单位开始的连比例个数字,以最后的素数个数字计算,单位个数字的下一个数字也将以同样数字整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"50cdc68006fefd59c345e2de713cf9339d1a5359bec04844d1e6ba1b0084b155","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be as many numbers as we please, A, B, C, D, beginning from an unit, and in continued proportion; I say that, by however many prime numbers D is measured, A will also be measured by the same."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们想多少数字就有多少,A,B,C,D,从单位开始,到连比例;我说,无论整除多少素数,D,A,也将用同样的标准来整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b4346f94381be8b735d687dbbe0c7a8fdc2015af5fd2cea3eb4e62ec633ffe66","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let D be measured by any prime number E; I say that E measures A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D用任何素数 E来计量;我说,E 整除 A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"21a00d54cec77b6b9e6c5c878e4f1b708e7674b717b44c89240e91273c2bd51b","citations":["euclid-7-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For suppose it does not; now E is prime, and any prime number is prime to any which it does not measure; [[VII. 29](/principles/euclid-7-29)] therefore E, A are prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设它不会;现在E是首要的,任何素数是任何它不具有整除的;因此E,A是互素。 [[VII. 29](/principles/euclid-7-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"663e6880230cf98fbfd2a63ad1b0c745c4a08a000cff5816e500b892d3b45f65","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since E measures D, let it measure it according to F, therefore E by multiplying F has made D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有自E9月30日以来F的整除因此,E乘以F 使D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"74e2f72ff15fea2740397e6ec9a43ebd31796bdf4cdb382e9dcc9f6f0f00e91f","citations":["euclid-9-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since A measures D according to the units in C, [[IX. 11 and Por.](/principles/euclid-9-11)] therefore A by multiplying C has made D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自C单位A 整除 D以来,A乘以C, 使D。 [[IX. 11 and Por.](/principles/euclid-9-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ac2a5c20b5fa314e5548b17fc4b47f645a6e8a5ebcf8a1316b3026afa6ce985a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, further, E has also by multiplying F made D; therefore the product of A, C is equal to the product of E, F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,还有E乘以F乘以D;因此,AC产品等于EF产品。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a57989de6d4f043768012d45857528e7a1bae9568c43cb504de7b1e0af8cbfaf","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as A is to E, so is F to C. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比E等于F比C；A 与 E 之比等于 F 与 C 之比。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"61ac4480449285ee90616f942bdab8833d58f6855e2c789d9baf8815e37b483c","citations":["euclid-7-21","euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A, E are prime, primes are also least, [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] and the least measure those which have the same ratio the same number of times, the antecedent the antecedent and the consequent the consequent; [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)] therefore E measures C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A,E是初级, 质数也最少, 而至少整除个相同比例的, 相同次数的, 之前的, 以及随之而来的结果; 因此, E, 整除, C。 [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":9,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f105ec266bdba26cde5648c8145e340f12eaeaa087f7e92cf964d6dbfdbec2af","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it measure it according to G; therefore E by multiplying G has made C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"G,整除,G,E乘以G,C"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc82a8ad33f92f8d99c9969f25d069fae3f06291bbbd61f1fa59ef97c2ad0ad4","citations":["euclid-9-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, further, by the theorem before this, A has also by multiplying B made C. [[IX. 11 and Por.](/principles/euclid-9-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A乘以B C 乘以C 乘以A 乘以A 乘以C 乘以A 乘以A [[IX. 11 and Por.](/principles/euclid-9-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"be00c0add334326240dfa464468e36ecc349fb9e0589dae963766485ffed8b7d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the product of A, B is equal to the product of E, G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,B的产值等于E,G的产值。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3bd8d533a3678ae2353a9fb4a9418647f4e2b57101e3baf2d81c7e7199d5cbf1","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as A is to E, so is G to B. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比E等于G比B；A 与 E 之比等于 G 与 B 之比。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fc33fad3ef423de8666f2411a9582c4457e63f9565a6d87237a159d84e10d3b7","citations":["euclid-7-21","euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A, E are prime, primes are also least, [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] and the least numbers measure those which have the same ratio with them the same number of times, the antecedent the antecedent and the consequent the consequent: [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)] therefore E measures B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A,E是初级, 质数也是最低的, 最少的整除个 与它们相同的比例 相同次数, 先例 和随之而来的结果: 因此, E, 整除, B。 [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":14,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a21d6864143d2fa22ffc5c522af434e316d21ef7c4c1c61b5c7a1cbdf1316cd9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it measure it according to H; therefore E by multiplying H has made B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"H,整除,H,E乘以H,B"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9b7fbaa4e20c12c1fd690f429fbc8537439dd4e03a9417c27326ce867932ac27","citations":["euclid-9-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But further A has also by multiplying itself made B; [[IX. 8](/principles/euclid-9-8)] therefore the product of E, H is equal to the square on A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但通过乘以本身,又有A种,即B种;因此E,H种产品等于A种。 [[IX. 8](/principles/euclid-9-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"08f25cef091e67f154845d6a0a2a4171e6aabf1ce2dc6e00e7eca64bf07e2fe9","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as E is to A, so is A to H. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,E对A的比等于A对H的比；E 与 A 之比等于 A 与 H 之比。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b9f38b3ca83f4d934a5017db31bf9cecf25642c760cc59f335c073a20b647a97","citations":["euclid-7-21","euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A, E are prime, primes are also least, [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] and the least measure those which have the same ratio the same number of times, the antecedent the antecedent and the consequent the consequent; [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)] therefore E measures A, as antecedent antecedent."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A,E是初级, 质数也是最低的, 而至少整除个相同比例的, 相同比例的, 之前的, 以及随之而来的结果; 因此, E, 整除, A, 之前的, 也是前的。 [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c708d22570573c3eb31451a7d86c0795a8710bf5e621cf357e6831f8cd341e15","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, again, it also does not measure it: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,它同样没有整除,这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e8ef7e8b4f42d68941f13a8c38aebf79afc857484d522155dd1cf61ff3fb5d3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore E, A are not prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,E,A不是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d863ee331597e32a8133541c86fb5a9f8e43c17c6a29047fdc652316c785883f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore they are composite to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,它们是相互结合的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ece14900d6a76f03aa31e86cd1e8bcfd09a2a1ed697a139c9e032a6e54a16756","citations":["euclid-7-def-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But numbers composite to one another are measured by some number. [[VII. Def. 14](/principles/euclid-7-def-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但数字相互结合,用一些数字来整除。 [[VII. Def. 14](/principles/euclid-7-def-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1b9afa0c74536520e973dd314816645e79e4e21f368c38888b8ebf53c5a7138","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since E is by hypothesis prime, and the prime is not measured by any number other than itself, therefore E measures A, E, so that E measures A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E是假设的本金, 并且本金不是用任何数字来整除的, 所以E 整除 A, E, 所以E 整除 A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ea3b6a313392509cd3dc0be3e4c2a97cf3bfb8a84d6753cd4c12fa54117df84a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"[But it also measures D; therefore E measures A, D.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"[但也有整除 D;因此E 整除 A D。 ]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":24,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f0eb73e5973ca5afdc3116ce38d7c89970e5ae3eab94f911b8780b5baf989db","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that, by however many prime numbers D is measured, A will also be measured by the same. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同理可以证明：无论有多少素数整除 D，这些素数也同样整除 A。证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-12.source","contentId":"euclid-9-12","revisionId":"euclid-9-12@raw-61d0ec606a6e30cb","order":25,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bbb27f103389efbde1ae823c751db27e3d734dcfaa0f3c6dfab9fafaaa06b278","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.12/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.12\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-12:euclid-7-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-12.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.12","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.12/","sourceLabel":"VII. 29"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-12:euclid-9-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-12.proof.3","euclid-9-12.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-9-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.12","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg0